ger conveyor, slide the conveyor down, and your burger is ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMER ORDER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/e4a39d3eadc87cd117934cd73438eb44.poster.avif?t=1761937131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/e4a39d3eadc87cd117934cd73438eb44.webm?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/e4a39d3eadc87cd117934cd73438eb44.mp4?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine customer orders carefully and try to prepare the correct burgers. Remember: every correct order means a satisfied customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>END OF DAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/428b2df14ce29f15fffe08d03a0e183a.poster.avif?t=1761937131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/428b2df14ce29f15fffe08d03a0e183a.webm?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/428b2df14ce29f15fffe08d03a0e183a.mp4?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay attention to the end of the day! Customers leave the shop at the end of the day. Try to get the orders out on time and finish the day as successfully as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TIME MANAGEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/dfebc832ddfb5de18c594dbeb2fe8060.poster.avif?t=1761937131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/dfebc832ddfb5de18c594dbeb2fe8060.webm?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/dfebc832ddfb5de18c594dbeb2fe8060.mp4?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't keep up with the orders, you can try to distract the customers; give them a ball of yarn to divert their attention, and try to use your time more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPPORT YOUR ASSISTANT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/4b69adc80ce915fb4cb21b22cc8dd9fc.poster.avif?t=1761937131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/4b69adc80ce915fb4cb21b22cc8dd9fc.webm?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/extras/4b69adc80ce915fb4cb21b22cc8dd9fc.mp4?t=1761937131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support your assistant, be there for them in difficult times, and try to manage the shop together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Cozy and relaxing time-management gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Run your own burger shop with the help of your adorable cat assistant</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Meet charming characters who visit your shop and influence the story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Demo content: limited levels included; full game unlocks more story paths and endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Upgrade your shop and speed up your workflow with daily earnings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Increasing challenge as days progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Cute and expressive cat-themed visuals and animations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kowal Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4119270","name":"Kitty Burger"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137260/5f86a7dd3d77a58e6c4733c626c1b157e2419533/header.jpg?t=1761937131","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4137260/166111783/e401e5e9ee1a4a7880f63e02bb1f126cf0ee2a27/1761768863/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761937129","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4137260/166111783/e401e5e9ee1a4a7880f63e02bb1f126cf0ee2a27/1761768863/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761937129","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4137260/166111783/e401e5e9ee1a4a7880f63e02bb1f126cf0ee2a27/1761768863/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761937129","id":257224336,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257224336/movie480.mp4?t=1761937129","max":"https://video.akamai.steamst