l day at Kitty Burger? This demo lets you serve warm burgers to purring customers and enjoy a few levels. Full game unlocks more content and continues beyond the demo\u2019s end.","steam_appid":4137260,"support_info":{"email":"kittyburgerinfo@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Turkish","type":"demo","website":null}